    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">各位前輩好:<div><br></div><div>有問題想請教，如何將數據集中重複的數值欄位只取第一筆並重新整合，如下所示</div><div><br></div><div>原始資料如下所示<br></div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-RW09RCznj_M/WORhQZ3u_TI/AAAAAAAAUu8/-h613ECpEEEOg2vVERsbIuVwBHNC7VuDwCLcB/s1600/1491361963173.jpg\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-RW09RCznj_M/WORhQZ3u_TI/AAAAAAAAUu8/-h613ECpEEEOg2vVERsbIuVwBHNC7VuDwCLcB/s1600/1491361963173.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237723613000&amp;usg=AOvVaw24wCTA0MFcdX8Mn0x83qc4\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-RW09RCznj_M/WORhQZ3u_TI/AAAAAAAAUu8/-h613ECpEEEOg2vVERsbIuVwBHNC7VuDwCLcB/s320/1491361963173.jpg\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"19\"></a><br><br><br>期望型態為下<br><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-SrqWG09k51Y/WORhYG6o0YI/AAAAAAAAUvA/40q7cfIH64cOwFS3fcinNFQTvHVjHcqnACLcB/s1600/1491362047702.jpg\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-SrqWG09k51Y/WORhYG6o0YI/AAAAAAAAUvA/40q7cfIH64cOwFS3fcinNFQTvHVjHcqnACLcB/s1600/1491362047702.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237723613000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1JZpqevi8-OAkT0xga2gal\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-SrqWG09k51Y/WORhYG6o0YI/AAAAAAAAUvA/40q7cfIH64cOwFS3fcinNFQTvHVjHcqnACLcB/s320/1491362047702.jpg\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"55\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>用了!duplicated確不是我想要的，煩請前輩幫忙</div><div><br></div><div>嘗試過以下方法1</div><div><div>i = 1 </div><div>while(i&lt;ncol(x)){</div><div>  ii = i+1</div><div>  while(ii&lt;=ncol(x)){</div><div>    if(sum(x[,i]==x[,ii],na.rm=T)==nrow(x)){</div><div>      x = x[,-ii]</div><div>      ii = ii-1</div><div>    }</div><div>    ii = ii+1</div><div>  }</div><div>  i = i+1</div><div>}</div></div><div><br></div><div>................................</div><div>方法2<br></div><div><div>indx &lt;- x %$% paste0() %&gt;% rle %$%</div><div>  cumsum(c(1, lengths)) %&gt;% .[1:(length(.)-1)]</div></div><div><br></div><div>謝謝</div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "hlSkTypaAAAJ",
