   "author": "d42e88b7645d03c8",
   "date": "2017-04-08T16:00:18Z",
   "subject": "Re: 重複連續數值，只取一欄位保存",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Jeffrey,<div><br></div><div>Please try and test:</div><div><br></div><div>1. 本題在於須選取任二欄比較, 類似數學上的組合 , 在R中可使用 combn 函數.</div><div><br></div><div>2. 比較二欄是否相同可使用 identical 函數</div><div><br></div><div>3. 將identical 函數結合至combn函數, 結果如下. 簡言之, 下列函數計算所有2欄比較結果.</div><div><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">combn</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ncol</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mydf</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> identical</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mydf</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mydf</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]]))</span></div></code></div><br></div><div>4. 本例中 for loop 目的是將TRUE 或 FALSE 結果, 依序對應至各欄, 為考量程式效益, </div><div>如果之前有指派為0, 表示已於之前比較結果為欄重複, 此時不用再比較, 參考程式中的二個 != 0 條件.</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-EAiCUY9s1so/WOkHrldtwjI/AAAAAAAALZk/O7o5n_-Oh6UOaBhfKN7jG_DVJg40XWY9ACLcB/s1600/%25E5%2588%25AA%25E9%2599%25A4%25E9%2587%258D%25E8%25A4%2587%25E6%25AC%2584.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-EAiCUY9s1so/WOkHrldtwjI/AAAAAAAALZk/O7o5n_-Oh6UOaBhfKN7jG_DVJg40XWY9ACLcB/s1600/%2525E5%252588%2525AA%2525E9%252599%2525A4%2525E9%252587%25258D%2525E8%2525A4%252587%2525E6%2525AC%252584.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237723617000&amp;usg=AOvVaw16ij2A91Rnu1qdzqr41-Gw\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-EAiCUY9s1so/WOkHrldtwjI/AAAAAAAALZk/O7o5n_-Oh6UOaBhfKN7jG_DVJg40XWY9ACLcB/s400/%25E5%2588%25AA%25E9%2599%25A4%25E9%2587%258D%25E8%25A4%2587%25E6%25AC%2584.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"400\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><div><font color=\"#666600\"># title: 刪除重複欄</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\"># date: 2017.4.8</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">mydf &lt;- read.table(text=&quot;</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>2<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>2<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>2<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>2<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>2<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>1</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>2<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>2<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0&quot;)</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\"># mydf &lt;- read.table(&quot;SN0008test.csv&quot;, header=TRUE, sep=&quot;,&quot;)</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">mydfcombn &lt;- combn(ncol(mydf), 2)</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">mydfflag &lt;- rep(999, length=ncol(mydf))</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">ind &lt;- combn(ncol(mydf),2, function(x) identical(mydf[,x[1]], mydf[,x[2]]))</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">for (i in 1:length(ind)) {</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">  </font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">  if ((mydfflag[mydfcombn[1,i]] != 0) &amp; (mydfflag[mydfcombn[2,i]] != 0)) {</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">    </font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">    if (ind[i] == TRUE) { # TRUE for identical</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">      mydfflag[mydfcombn[1,i]] &lt;- 1 # 1 for reserved</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">      mydfflag[mydfcombn[2,i]] &lt;- 0 # 2 for removed</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">    } else { # FLASE for different</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">      mydfflag[mydfcombn[1,i]] &lt;- 1</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">      mydfflag[mydfcombn[2,i]] &lt;- 1</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">    }</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">  }</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">  </font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">  # print(paste0(&quot;i = &quot;, i, &quot;***&quot;))</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">  # print(mydfflag)</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">}</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">mydfflag</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">mydf</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\">mydf[, mydfflag == TRUE ]</font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\"># end</font></div></div></code></div></div><div><br></div><div>Jeffrey於 2017年4月5日星期三 UTC+8上午11時17分32秒寫道：</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">各位前輩好:<div><br></div><div>有問題想請教，如何將數據集中重複的數值欄位只取第一筆並重新整合，如下所示</div><div><br></div><div>原始資料如下所示<br></div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-RW09RCznj_M/WORhQZ3u_TI/AAAAAAAAUu8/-h613ECpEEEOg2vVERsbIuVwBHNC7VuDwCLcB/s1600/1491361963173.jpg\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-RW09RCznj_M/WORhQZ3u_TI/AAAAAAAAUu8/-h613ECpEEEOg2vVERsbIuVwBHNC7VuDwCLcB/s1600/1491361963173.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237723617000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2dbk0drJct9bfRN-RdNvvW\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-RW09RCznj_M/WORhQZ3u_TI/AAAAAAAAUu8/-h613ECpEEEOg2vVERsbIuVwBHNC7VuDwCLcB/s320/1491361963173.jpg\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"19\"></a><br><br><br>期望型態為下<br><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-SrqWG09k51Y/WORhYG6o0YI/AAAAAAAAUvA/40q7cfIH64cOwFS3fcinNFQTvHVjHcqnACLcB/s1600/1491362047702.jpg\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-SrqWG09k51Y/WORhYG6o0YI/AAAAAAAAUvA/40q7cfIH64cOwFS3fcinNFQTvHVjHcqnACLcB/s1600/1491362047702.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237723617000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3tdUPWZ6mqO2RsttpJVeEj\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-SrqWG09k51Y/WORhYG6o0YI/AAAAAAAAUvA/40q7cfIH64cOwFS3fcinNFQTvHVjHcqnACLcB/s320/1491362047702.jpg\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"55\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>用了!duplicated確不是我想要的，煩請前輩幫忙</div><div><br></div><div>嘗試過以下方法1</div><div><div>i = 1 </div><div>while(i&lt;ncol(x)){</div><div>  ii = i+1</div><div>  while(ii&lt;=ncol(x)){</div><div>    if(sum(x[,i]==x[,ii],na.rm=T)==nrow(x)){</div><div>      x = x[,-ii]</div><div>      ii = ii-1</div><div>    }</div><div>    ii = ii+1</div><div>  }</div><div>  i = i+1</div><div>}</div></div><div><br></div><div>................................</div><div>方法2<br></div><div><div>indx &lt;- x %$% paste0() %&gt;% rle %$%</div><div>  cumsum(c(1, lengths)) %&gt;% .[1:(length(.)-1)]</div></div><div><br></div><div>謝謝</div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p></div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
