     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">WEPA您好:<div><br></div><div>參照您的code進行嘗試，以您的範例來說<span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">0</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\">，我想保留為01012120如此，遇到重複的連續值才縮排</font></span></div><div><font color=\"#666600\" face=\"monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"monospace\" color=\"#000000\">我期望的結果為只要左右相鄰的值皆為相同值，就只留一筆 </font></div><div><font face=\"monospace\" color=\"#000000\">EX.</font></div><div><font face=\"monospace\" color=\"#000000\">起始資料(各連續數值長度不ㄧ) : </font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\" face=\"monospace\">000111111122222233333333444111110000</font><font face=\"monospace\"><font color=\"#000000\"> </font></font></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);font-family:monospace\">000000111122222233334444444110000000</span><font face=\"monospace\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></font></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:monospace\">最後呈現為 : </span></div><div><font color=\"#7f6000\"><span style=\"font-family:monospace\">0123410</span><br></font></div><div><span style=\"font-family:monospace\"><font color=\"#7f6000\">0123410</font></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:monospace\"><font color=\"#7f6000\"><br></font></span></div><div><font color=\"#7f6000\" face=\"monospace\">我近期嘗試了一段code，但是只要長度不一樣就會有沒辦法完全縮排的情況(將資料加入id跟value進行)(數據於附檔附上參考)，如以下所示</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"monospace\">## 讀檔</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"monospace\">x = read.csv(&quot;C:/Users/MIRDC-041955/Desktop/datatest/SN0008testBig.csv&quot;, header=T, sep=&quot;,&quot;)</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"monospace\">## 鍛造力重複連續數值合併，保留一欄位</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"monospace\">indx = x %$% paste0(id, value) %&gt;% rle %$%</font></div></div>"
